{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13107050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13107050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1310705001:1":{"text":"이게 여러분이 만든 눈사람인가요? 좋네요, 아주 좋아요! 정확하게 말하자면, 오늘 본 눈사람 중 가장 멋있어요!","source_cn":"这是你们堆的雪人？不错，真不错！确切地说，是我今天见过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x941C01125854B48D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310705002:1":{"text":"진짜 꽃잎을 받을 자격이 있어요!","source_cn":"你们值得一片真正的花瓣！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDB3C16D4000F83F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310705003:0":{"text":"이런, 벌써 꽃잎을 가지고 있군요? 제가 여러분에게 꽃잎을 드렸나 보네요. 저도 건망증이 참 심하다니까요...","source_cn":"哎呀，你们已经有花瓣了？看来我给过你们了。唉，我真是忘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD73302124E2C4140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祭典办事员":{"text":"축제 직원","source":"祭典办事员","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}